ch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8                                                                Speak}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Of all the cities he saw, the minds he grasped,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 The suffering deep in his heart at sea}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 As he struggled to survive and bring his men home}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 But could not save them, hard as he tried}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 The fools--destroyed by their own recklessness}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 When they ate the oxen of Hyperion, the Sun,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 And that god snuffed out their day of return.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8                                        Of these things }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Speak, Immortal One,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 And tell the tale once more in our time.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 By now, all the others who had fought at Troy}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 at least those who had survived the war and the sea}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Were safely back home. Only Odysseus}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Still longed to return to his home and his wife.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 The nymph Calypso, a powerful goddess}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 And beautiful}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 was clinging to him}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 In her caverns and yearned to possess him.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 The seasons rolled by, and the year came}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 In which the gods spun the thread}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 For Odysseus to return home to Ithaca,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Though not even there did his troubles end,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Even with his dear one around him.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 All the gods pitied him, except Poseidon,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Who stormed against the godlike hero}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Until he finally reached his own native land.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 But Poseidon was away now, among the Ethiopians,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Those burnished people at the ends of the earth}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \