mer}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 The Odyssey}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Translated by Joe Sachs}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Philadelphia 2014}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 [Sample from the Opening of the Poem]}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 A man, resourceful but forced into so many wanderings from the time}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 he sacked the sacred stronghold of Troy}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 sing me his story, Muse.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 There were many people whose town he saw, whose minds he took}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 the measure of, and many miseries he suffered at sea, sick at heart,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 while trying to earn his own life and a way home for his shipmates.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 But there was no saving those shipmates, determined as he was;}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 they were undone by their own reckless acts. With no more sense}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 than infants they fell on the cattle of the sun god Hyperion and}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 ate them. The god robbed }{\i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 them}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8  of the }{\i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 day}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 their day of homecoming.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Start anywhere, goddess, daughter of Zeus, and tell the story again for us.   }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 When all the rest who had escaped utter destruction}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 were home, survivors of the war and also of the sea,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 he alone was still yearning for his homecoming and his wife,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 kept in the cavernous lair of the queenly nymph Calypso,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 a goddess among goddesses, who wanted him for a husband.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Time sailed its monotonous circuit, but when the year came round}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 in which the gods had spun his destiny to return to Ithaca,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 he was not home free even there; his struggles continued,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 even among his own loved ones. All the gods took pity on him,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 apart from Poseidon; he went on with his raging fury                                     }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 at godlike Odyseys to the moment of his arrival in his own land.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 But Poseidon was far from home, gone off to the Ethiopians}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 the Ethiopians who are the most remote of men in either direction;}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 they live where Hyperion sets and also where he rises.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 He went to receive their sacrifice of a hundred bulls and rams,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 and he was right there for the feast, partaking with gusto. The rest}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 of the gods were gathered in the palace of Olympian Zeus,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 and the first to speak among them was the father of men and gods.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 His heart was mindful of Aegisthus, a man not to be trifled with,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Yet Agamemnon\uc1 \u8217 ?s far-famed son Orestes had killed him.                     }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 With him in mind, he spoke among the immortal ones, saying:}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8220 ?Incredible how quick mortals are to blame the gods!}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 They claim all their evils come from us, when their own}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 reckless acts get them sufferings outstripping what's fated;}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 and now Aegisthus oversteps fate and marries Agamemnon\uc1 \u8217 ?s}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 lawful wedded wife, then kills him when he comes home,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 knowing it would be utter destruction; we told him so beforehand!}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 We sent Hermes, who sees far and appears in a flash,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 to warn him not to kill the man or seduce the wife,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 since there would be vengeance from the line of Atreus, from Orestes}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 when the time came that he grew up and yearned for his own land.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 That's what Hermes told him, but he couldn't get that into the stubborn heart}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 of Aegisthus, even for his own good, and now he's paid the price in one lump sum.\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 REVIEW COMMENT}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 In his preface Sachs announces what sounds like a paradoxical intent: \uc1 \u8220 ?Just as this translation does its best to give you the feel of the poem without poetry of its own, it strives to give you an accurate rendering of the poet's word without being what is called \uc1 \u8216 ?literal.\uc1 \u8217 ?\uc1 \u8221 ? I fail to see how such a prosaic and at times cumbersome. awkward, and thoroughly unmusical style comes close to conveying \uc1 \u8220 ?the feel of the poem.\uc1 \u8221 ?The text stays close to Homer's and is clear enough, but the periphrastic style lacks any sense of imaginative energy.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 For a sample and review comment on Sachs's translation of the }{\i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Iliad}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 , use the following link: }{\field \fldedit {\*\fldinst {\b1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 }{\b1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8  HYPERLINK \'5cl "iliadsachs" }}{\fldrslt {\b1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 }{\cs15 \b1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf14 \ul Sachs }{\cs15 \b1 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf14 \ul Iliad}}}{\cs15 \b1 \i1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf14 \ul }{\i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 .}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard