 the opening of the poem. This sample is taken from a paperback version of the poem]}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 MO\uc1 \u218 ?SA\uc1 \u202 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 tell me about the man and his great will and the vastness of his many wanderings}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 after the sacred citadel of Troi\uc1 \u234 ? was destroyed by him.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Many the cities and the people\uc1 \u8217 ?s minds he saw and learned}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 many the agonies upon sea he suffered in his heart}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 fighting for life and for his men\uc1 \u8217 ?s return}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 But he could not save his men, despite his desire}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 destroyed by their own depravity,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 the fools, they ate the oxen of Huperi\uc1 \u244 ?n \uc1 \u202 ?elios,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 who took away from them their day\uc1 \u8217 ?s return.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Speak of these things, goddess daughter of Ze\uc1 \u250 ?s,even to us.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 All others who escaped their fall and death }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 were then at home, escaping war and sea}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 he was alone, longing for home and his wife}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 held by Kalups\uc1 \u244 ?, adored of  of the Numph\uc1 \u234 ?si, divine of goddesses}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 in hollow caves, desiring him to marry her.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 But when the years revolved, the year had come}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 destined by gods he would return to his home }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 to Ithak\uc1 \u234 ?, not even there escaped he suffering }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 from friends. Pitied by all the gods,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 except Poseida\uc1 \u244 ?n, whose rage would never end}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 againstgod-like  Oduse\uc1 \u250 ?s before he reached his own land.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Poseida\uc1 \u244 ?n was with Aithi\uc1 \u243 ?pessi, their existence is far away,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 divided into two, the Aithi\uc1 \u243 ?pessi on the edges of mankind,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 some where Huperi\uc1 \u244 ?n sets, some where he rises, }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 to receive a hecatomb of bulls and rams.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 There Poseida\uc1 \u244 ?n sat, rejoicing at the feast}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 the other gods}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 together gathered in Ze\uc1 \u250 ?s\uc1 \u8217 ?s \uc1 \u211 ?lumpos halls.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 The father of men and gods spoke first to them}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 his heart remembering A\uc1 \u237 ?gisthos nobleness,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 killed by Agamemonid\uc1 \u234 ?s Orest\uc1 \u234 ?s, glorified far away.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Remembering him, Ze\uc1 \u250 ?s spoke to the immortals:}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8220 ?See how the living blame the gods}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 for they say their evil is from us but they themselves,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 by their depravity suffer beyond their fate.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 As even now, beyond his fate, A\uc1 \u237 ?gisthos seduced}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Atre\uc1 \u239 ?d\uc1 \u233 ?s wedded wife, and killed him when he returned,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 knew his fall and death. We told him this before,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 sending Herme\uc1 \u237 ?as Arge\uc1 \u239 ?phont\uc1 \u234 ?s to watch him well,}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 neither to kill the man nor seduce his wife}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 for Atre\uc1 \u239 ?d\uc1 \u233 ?s was be avenged by Orest\uc1 \u234 ?s}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 when he became a man and  longed for his own land.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 So he was told by Herme\uc1 \u237 ?as but his good heart}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 did not persuade A\uc1 \u237 ?gisthos\uc1 \u8217 ? mind}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af0 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af0 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 who now atones for all.\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 REVIEW COMMENT}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 [This comment was based on the first printing of the translation, which was significantly different from the revised version above. However, I have left the comment unchanged, even though the revisions to the first version have addressed some of my concerns.]}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Mann has made a number of interesting (some might say idiosyncratic) choices in his translation. His free verse is based on an \uc1 \u8220 ?infinite (or French) iambic\uc1 \u8221 ? so that each line \uc1 \u8220 ?is as long as it needs to be, without being constrained or forced to obey an artificial line length\uc1 \u8221 ?; he has decided to eschew punctuation marks as much as possible; and he renders the Greek names of people and places by transliterating the Greek as faithfully as possible, with the help of various accents. In the appendix to the translation he offers a defence of these decisions, but such explanations, here and in other translations, are irrelevant. What matters is the translation itself. How have these decisions affected the quality of this English version of Homer?}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 While the diction of the translation is accurate and clear, the lack of a regular poetic form and the scarcity of punctuation seriously affect the overall tone of the poem, which (to me) is curiously flat. Reading the text is easy enough, but Mann offers little help to the reader in providing some energy to the lines. Punctuation, after all, is not merely a matter of clarifying the syntax; it also guides the reader through the pauses and determines in large part the momentum of the poem (as does a regular rhythm). The lack of such help means that reading the text (especially out loud) is a slow business, because readers have to construct the rhythm and the pauses as they proceed.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Consider the effect of these aspects of the style is one of the most dramatic moments in the poem, the blinding of Polyphemus. The English is clear and accurate but the overall tone is relatively calm and expansive, the sort of description an accurate and objective observer might make, ensuring that each point in his description is equally important. What\uc1 \u8217 ?s lacking is an intense feeling for the drama of the moment.}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 About Mann\uc1 \u8217 ?s treatment of the Greek names, I\uc1 \u8217 ?m of two minds. The strangeness of the Greek name does make familiar figures more remote, mysterious, and grand. On the other hand, some student readers will certainly find it difficult to get used to the practice (I learned that from using Robert Fitzgerald\uc1 \u8217 ?s translation in undergraduate courses).}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 \par }\pard \plain \s22 \li0 \ri0 \sb100 \sa100 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 {\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 These remarks I should qualify by the observation that Mann is an experienced actor and has recorded on YouTube his own reading of parts of his }{\i1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 Odyssey}{\fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 . The sample is remarkable and well worth listening to. You can access it here: }{\field \fldedit {\*\fldinst {\b1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 }{\b1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8  HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZrr7erEh6Y" }}{\fldrslt {\b1 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \cf8 }{\cs17 \b1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf10 \ul Mann Audio}}}{\cs17 \b1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \af4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf10 \ul }{\cs17 \b1 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf10 \ul .}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af4 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \alang1 \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af4 \loch \f4 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe2052 \langfenp2052 \alang1 \par }}